cc-usd (lib/usd) — CadCraft's own OpenUSD reader and writer. Apache-2.0, Copyright DDG / the CadCraft authors.

The text format, the schemas (UsdGeom, UsdShade, UsdLux, UsdSkel), composition rules and the USDZ package rules were
written from the published OpenUSD documentation. The binary ("crate", .usdc) layout — the bootstrap, table of contents,
structural sections, value representations, inlined values, compressed arrays, the integer coding and the chunked LZ4
wrapper — is not documented outside the reference library, so usdc-read.js, usdc-write.js, intcode.js and lz4.js
follow the layout found in the reference library's sources (pxr/usd/sdf/crateFile.{h,cpp}, integerCoding.cpp,
pxr/base/tf/fastCompression.cpp), read as a reference after a licence check (docs/0.7-sessions/usd.md). The code here
is our own JavaScript. The reference library carries this notice:

  OpenUSD
