  "Trademarks"); https://github.com/PixarAnimationStudios/OpenUSD/blob/release/LICENSE.txt

The LZ4 block format is from its published description (LZ4 Block Format Description, BSD-2-Clause, Yann Collet).
"USD", "OpenUSD" and "USDZ" name the file formats; no trademark of Pixar or the Alliance for OpenUSD is used otherwise.
